/-! # cm-branch2: the fold dry run on the current top, with the manuscript's CM branch

`sixContactMin_of_open72_cm2` is the current top theorem `HDec.HSyn.sixContactMin_of_open72` (TailZ79) with one
extra hypothesis `c : CMBranch.CMInputs2` (the CM-branch inputs still open), and with the base of the chain,
`sixContactMin_of_open4_hf_pz_eb` (FS5 / NoCM from González–Rotger, the `X₆` Kummer fibre and
`cmOptimalEmbedding`), replaced by cm-branch's `sixContactMin_of_open4_cm`. Every intermediate theorem
`sixContactMin_of_openN…` is copied verbatim (generated by `scratch/cm-branch2/gen/mk_top2.py`) with `c` threaded.

Compared with cm-branch's `CMInputs` (Top.lean), two of the three glue inputs are gone: `HeightAdditivityUpper` is
proved from the chain's textbook field `t35` (`CMBranch.heightAdditivityUpper_of_t35`, `CMBranch/HeightAdd.lean`), and
`ReducedCMPeriod` from `t35`, `homLatticeCorr`, `t11b` and the new textbook leaf `CoxProperLattice`
(`CMBranch.reducedCMPeriod_of_leaves`, `CMBranch/PeriodLattice.lean`, `CMBranch/ReducedPeriod.lean`).
-/

namespace HDec
set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000
noncomputable section

namespace CMBranch
/-- **The CM-branch inputs still open** (docs/research/cm-branch2.md): the leaves `FowlerProp27`, `CMHeight62`,
`CMjDegree`, `CMPotentialGood`, `CoxProperLattice` and the glue `CMFibreSplit`. -/
structure CMInputs2 : Prop where
  cmFibreSplit : CMFibreSplit
  fowlerProp27 : FowlerProp27
  cmjDegree : CMjDegree
  cmPotentialGood : CMPotentialGood
  cmHeight62 : CMHeight62
  coxProperLattice : CoxProperLattice
end CMBranch

namespace HSyn
open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry G0Split

